OL,3,GNEWSAVeteran 'fell between services'
OL,4,Abefore death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former soldier who suffered serious
OL,7,Finjuries in Afghanistan and struggled
OL,8,Fwith chronic pain and PTSD before his
OL,9,Fdeath appears to have "fallen between
OL,10,Fservices", a coroner found.
OL,12,FRichard Preece, 42, was found dead at
OL,13,Fhis home in Aylesford in June 2025
OL,14,Fafter years of concerns about
OL,15,Fself-neglect and his deteriorating
OL,16,Fwellbeing.
OL,18,FJyoti Gill, assistant coroner for Kent
OL,19,Fand Medway, said in a prevention of
OL,20,Ffuture deaths report there had been
OL,21,Fthree safeguarding referrals linked to
OL,22,FPreece between 2022 and 2025.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,322,320,200,140,0,100
